    "check": "block images read: DJ 8 Jan 1923 p6 (section 2.113, block 3): the West Ward's 'present representatives - Aldermen Meenan and Conn Bradley, Councillors Carlin, Hegarty, Logue, M'Kernan, M'Clean, and Shiel - are deemed to have been re-elected'; DJ 10 Jan 1923 p5: the Returning Officer's notice (dated 8 January 1923) that no candidates were nominated for the South and West Wards and their retiring aldermen and councillors are deemed re-elected; the eight match the eight members returned for the West Ward in January 1920.",
